     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "<i>-We know they've likely sent some infiltrators.. their whereabouts is unknown as of this moment, intel peps are working hard to try and get more information.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "<i>Access to LAWs, Silencers, Flares."\
     "Access to no vehicle that we know of</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "<i>Ambush us along our way to the base to prevent the fuel to reach the Mi-24</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "<i>Ambush us along the way, kill us before using our uniforms to infiltrate the base</i>"\
     ""\
