    GC_Briefing "{E726E71ACA5B5D17}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "<i>Kill the HVT (Supreme Commander) or if unable, destroy 4x Objectives to make this mission a success (Check Mission Notes)"\
     ""\
     "Antennas & Generators needs 2-3x Demoblocks each placed RIGHT on them"\
     "-- Generators will disable sections of lights and power throughout the Villa Base"\
     "Ammodump needs 1-2x Demoblocks"\
     "-- They blow up with Force, be mindful</i>"\
     "Mi-24 Can be destroyed by using the Iglas OR Zu-23-2, ZU is more reliable than the Igla"\
     "-- Can try to disable it mid-air with the M107.. Good luck dont forget to Zero the gun."\
     ""\
     "--------------------------------------------------------------------------"\
     ""\
     "<b>a. Optional Side Task:</b>"\
     ""\
     "<i>Reports mention that the Mi-24 Hind is out of fuel and that a Relief Convoy is inbound from the East, intercept the convoy."\
     ""\
     "Should you be successful, you can utilize the soldiers uniform and the truck itself to attempt to bypass their security, perhaps even reaching the Supreme Commander himself.. Be mindful of Challenge/Pass</i>"\
     ""\
     "--------------------------------------------------------------------------"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Difficulty Check!:</b>"\
     "<i>- Using the Boat Insertion will be extremely hard, do it at your own expense.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Mission Maker Note:</b>"\
     "<i>- Youre not allowed to send individual players to go Rambo, minimum a buddy team.. please dear god. Or try to keep the squads together"\
     "- Please do not spend 5-15min motionless in a forest doing nothing, keep poking and finding insert points through OPFOR's defences, you can always pull Backwards into the darkness</i>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5D64933689D27A50}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "II. Mission:"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "<i>Deliver the fuel truck to the military site to refuel the Mi-24, then attach to the Company Commander stationed there until further notice.</i>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B28542768E991BE9}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "II. Mission:"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "<i>Patrol our assigned area, prevent the destruction of our vital Infastructure (Antenna, Generators) and Ammunition that has arrived by boat.. and make sure our Supreme Commander does not get killed.. Nor the destruction of our Mi-24"\
     ""\
     "Our Mi-24 is currently out of fuel, a fuel truck will be arriving shortly coming in from the East. If the Fuel Truck does not make it, the Mi-24 will be stranded on the ground and be useless.</i>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR" "CIV"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DA20E6E84F940C29}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "<i>Move in stealth, destroy 4x of our objectives or killing the HVT himself.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "<i>Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "Move in to recon to find the easy routes before taking out any less defended objectives before extracting.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "<i>Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is adviced to either keep the squads together or in minimum 2x man buddy teams, allows for easy maneuvers and quick reaction</i>"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{87C382972F32CD28}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "<i>Sent to render aid to the military site and refuel a Mi-24</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "<i>Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "Is it adviced enter through the main gate so the garrisons can see and get us in.. though it can be dangerous</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "<i>Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is adviced to keep a BRDM front and rear of the fuel truck while we move</i>"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{FA37A99110D59392}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "<i>Send out Platoons to patrol our assigned area, check in on our vital infastructure and health of our Supreme Commander, and be prepared for the inevitable US invasion in the coming weeks</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "<i>Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "Is it adviced to have some squads patroling each objective so to prevent them from easily destroy them</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "<i>Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is adviced to setup patrols and maneuver routes, ontop of flare codes to signify situations</i>"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR" "CIV"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B15DAB99FBB294B1}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "<i>Dress: Standard US Green Beret Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard US Green Beret  Loadout</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "<i>Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     "3x 9K38 Iglas have been left hidden around the AO by our double agents, they should be marked on our map."\
     ""\
     "1x Crate at Spawn contains:"\
     "- 90x Orange Flares"\
     "- 90x Green Flares"\
     "- 90x White Flares"\
     "- 1x M107 50.Call + 3x mags Tracer AP + Scope"\
     "- 2x M60 Machinegun + 10x 100rnd Belt (1tracer every 4 FMJ)"\
     "- 4x M72 LAW"\
     "- 18x Alice Backpacks</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "<i>Location: Squad Aid Post is to be setup by Squad medics."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Squad medpack carried by Squad medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "<i>4x Transport RHIB"\
     "2x Minigun RHIB</i>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
