    GC_Briefing "{D8A47B32BA4BFE27}" {
     m_iOrder 19
     m_sTitle "VI. Mission Notes (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "Timelimit: 60m"\
     "Setup Timer: 2.5min (To allow Defenders to get to Positions)"\
     ""\
     "- Mi-24 Pilots, YOU ARE NOT to turn off the spotlights, colition lights nor hazard lights. Should be unavailable to interact but BI sucks."\
     ""\
     "- HVT Supreme Commander is only able to remain at his residence, where he has a \"Oh Shit\" room setup.. for total Supreme Reasons."\
     ""\
     "- US are allowed to pickup and utilize USSR's uniforms for disguise."\
     "Both Teams are allowed to pickup radios from dead players."\
     ""\
     "Nametags are turned off.. "\
     ""\
     "GM Discretion as usual."\
     ""\
     ""\
